# Build context for packaging/container/Dockerfile (run from app/).
# Allow-list: send only what the Dockerfile COPYs. Without this, docker build
# also uploads the macOS and Windows vendored binaries (~350 MB) it never uses.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!constraints.txt
!src
!packaging/vendor/blast/linux-x64
!packaging/vendor/mafft/linux-x64
!packaging/container/write_build_id.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
